@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed exact criterion, design and evidence trace chain
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

rectangle "Identified source criterion\nExact locator / wording / revision / status" as S
rectangle "Analysis refinement\nScenario / rule / state / information meaning" as A
rectangle "Technical realization\nOwner + exact operation / model / runtime locations" as D
rectangle "Reasoned comparison\nNormal and exception paths + unchanged protected state" as C
rectangle "Verification plan / actual evidence\nCandidate, environment, method, observations and limits" as E
rectangle "Finding and scoped disposition\nActual reviewer / owner decision / remaining gap" as F
S --> A
A --> D
D --> C
S --> C : compare exact obligation
C --> E
E --> F
note bottom of F
 A valid link is not semantic coverage.
 A plan is not a product-test result.
 Inherited inventory counts are not fresh design comparisons.
end note
@enduml
